{{also|Arthritis}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἀρθρῖτις||joint-disease, gout}}, from {{m|grc|ἄρθρον||a joint}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɑː(ɹ)θˈɹaɪtɪs/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|arthritides}}

# [[inflammation|Inflammation]] of a [[joint]] or joints causing [[pain]] and/or [[disability]], swelling and stiffness, and due to various causes such as [[infection]], [[trauma]], degenerative changes or [[metabolic]] disorders.

